stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Wrapper terminal readable
  s1: First reply queued
  s2: First reply visible in Discord
  s3: Outbox confirms the first answer
  s4: Inflight gone and idle grace active
  s5: Idle replay eligible
  s6: First replay settled
  s7: Both answers visible once
  s8: Later headless answer sent
  [*] --> s0
