  s2 --> s3: confirm outbox sent
  s3 --> s4: remove inflight
  s4 --> s5: ten-second grace expires
  s5 --> s6: consume proven span
  s6 --> s7: idle relay posts span
  s6 --> s8: confirm outbox sent
  s8 --> s7: consume proven span
